&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3241 - Associate Director, Planning - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fantastic opportunity to join the Tesco team as a Planning Associate Director.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Associate Director, you are critical to the delivery of this ambition; working closely with the Senior Associate Director, you will be a key interface for our clients and lead planning projects from start to finish, acting as the conduit who brings together our specialists to deliver exceptional work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will oversee the day-to-day running of the account, ensuring flow and accuracy of work and that the campaign management process follows best practice. You are across all communications and establish yourself as the first port of call for clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build a strong relationship with your clients and become a trusted strategic partner – showing a deep understanding of your clients’ business and how communications can drive growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;environment by&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong management and client relationship skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People management skills to support AD in the management and development of Planners and Execs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution focused mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm, curiosity, and a team player mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated; an ambition to make the ordinary extraordinary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A thirst to learn – be that the client’s business, people, brands, industry, trends etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to prioritise and delegate, as well as manage both up and down&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathetic and self-aware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated to drive business results for both client &amp;amp; EssenceMediacom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive, proactive approach to problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurate verbal and written feedback and instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Engineering Manager to lead Team Pegasus, responsible for the Awin Mobile App and its backend platform. Pegasus is part of the Publisher Tribe that builds the experiences publishers rely on every day: discovering opportunities, generating links, tracking performance, and growing their partnerships on the go.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is focused primarily on the creator-focused mobile app. You will lead two teams that bring it to life:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pegasus Mobile&lt;/strong&gt;, building our Flutter-based mobile application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pegasus Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, providing the APIs and backend services that power the mobile app and our publisher web experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a leadership role, not a hands-on coding role, but we expect strong technical depth so you can guide the team and unblock delivery when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Tasks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor engineers, fostering their growth and career development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive recruitment efforts and ensure successful onboarding for new team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct performance reviews, track individual development plans, and provide regular feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Product Manager to define team objectives and OKRs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable the team to take ownership of the software delivery lifecycle and drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate discussions and decision-making processes within the team, resolving conflicts when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Product, UX and other engineering teams to deliver on shared goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion AI-assisted development, code generation and agentic coding workflows to accelerate delivery across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to knowledge sharing and promote a culture of learning within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the strategic direction of the Engineering Management group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 2 years of experience as an Engineering Manager, Technical Lead or equivalent leadership position, with a clear servant-leadership and empowering management style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, hands-on experience building and shipping mobile applications in a commercial setting, ideally apps you have helped launch and scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product mindset, comfortable collaborating with Product and UX on discovery and shaping outcomes, not just executing requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend and cloud literacy sufficient to lead the Platform team (backend, API, AWS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI-assisted development, code generation and agentic coding workflows to accelerate delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator across technical and non-technical audiences, comfortable adopting language based on the room.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in an Agile setup (Scrum or Kanban), facilitating ceremonies and supporting the team through change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Flutter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product experience in the creator economy, for example creator tooling, affiliate or creator monetisation platforms, or influencer-facing products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience orchestrating multi-agent AI workflows for engineering or product use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;RichTextList-bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-Week&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritise your mental health and wellbeing by offering you a four-day Flexi-Week (with one lighter or completely disconnected day per week) at full pay, with no reduction to your annual holiday allowance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-office&lt;/strong&gt;: We offer an international culture and flexibility through our hybrid/remote working scheme which is designed to foster a culture of mutual trust and working flexibility.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Expense Contribution &amp;amp; Remote Working Furniture&lt;/strong&gt;: You will receive a monthly allowance to cover part of your running costs, as well as a furniture package to support you in setting up a comfortable workspace when working from home.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health and Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;: With our support and access to various initiatives and sports offers, you can focus on your mental and physical wellbeing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development&lt;/strong&gt;: We’ve built our extensive training suite, Awin Academy, to cover a wide range of skills that support your professional and personal growth, with trainings conveniently packaged to help your overall development.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Appreciation&lt;/strong&gt;: Thank and reward colleagues by sending them a voucher through our peer-to-peer recognition programme.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are hiring in multiple countries for this role. Additional benefits, including health and wellbeing offerings, will be discussed during the initial interview.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 2000, Awin is proud of our dynamic, social and inclusive culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Like all businesses, we’ve had to adapt and nurture our culture in a virtual environment. Our virtual ‘Life @ Awin’ hub brings our colleagues from across the globe together for various social activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion are paramount to us, and we proudly pursue and hire diverse team members. We champion uniqueness and authenticity; this is who we are at our core. Our network of affiliate partnerships are diverse and transparent, as are the employees powering our vision to build the world’s leading open partner ecosystem. We welcome all backgrounds, identities, and experiences. If you need support at any point in the application or interview process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot;&gt;Awin is part of the Axel Springer group.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot;&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;Hyperlink SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axelspringer.com/en/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight Underlined SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;axelspringer.com/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;en&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot;&gt;, and explore the Axel Springer Essentials here:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;Hyperlink SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axelspringer.com/en/inside/the-essentials-what-we-have-adapted-and-why&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight Underlined SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;axelspringer.com/en/inside/the-essentials-what-we-have-adapted-and-why&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now to begin the next stage of your career at a progressive company that supports both your professional and personal development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-RS1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Parloa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa’s mission is to make every customer conversation feel effortless for both customers and the companies serving them. As agentic AI accelerates, Parloans are shaping the foundation of a new era in customer experience, one where customer support is no longer transactions, but meaningful exchanges. It is not just a vision; Parloa has powered over ONE BILLION interactions between global enterprise brands and their customers, with companies like Booking.com, HealthEquity, Allianz, SAP, BarmeniaGothaer, and TUI already deploying Parloa at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Manager, Forward Deployed Engineering &lt;/strong&gt;at Parloa, you’ll be on the front lines of enterprise AI adoption — leading a high-impact team of FDEs that delivers our most strategic enterprise deployments. Your mission is to ensure our consistent deployment excellence: predictable delivery, strong engineering quality, and fast unblocking in complex enterprise environments — while staying technically credible yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FDEs are our in-field engineers. They build what doesn’t exist yet, adapt architecture to enterprise realities, and engineer integrations across systems and APIs to make deployments successful. As a Manager, you make that work repeatable and reliable across multiple customer projects — through strong delivery leadership, clear priorities, and hands-on technical guidance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Areas of ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the team:&lt;/strong&gt; hire, coach, and grow a team of FDEs; set clear expectations; run 1:1s, feedback cycles, and performance development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own capacity planning and staffing:&lt;/strong&gt; allocate engineers across parallel strategic projects, manage load and utilization, and anticipate delivery bottlenecks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive project delivery management:&lt;/strong&gt; own engineering delivery across deployments — milestones, dependencies, risk management, escalation paths, and stakeholder alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish time tracking and delivery visibility:&lt;/strong&gt; implement lightweight tracking and reporting that creates trusted insight into effort, progress, and capacity (without bureaucracy).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide technical leadership and escalation support:&lt;/strong&gt; guide architecture and implementation choices, review designs/code when needed, and unblock high-severity issues in production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create scalable field engineering practices:&lt;/strong&gt; build reusable patterns, playbooks, and standards that improve reliability, maintainability, and speed across deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the product via field learnings: &lt;/strong&gt;translate recurring customer needs into clear productization proposals and partner with Product/Core Engineering to reduce one-offs over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with customer engineering and enterprise stakeholders:&lt;/strong&gt; collaborate directly with customer teams (architecture, security, platform) to deliver outcomes and build long-term technical trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech Stack:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typescript, NodeJS, OpenAI, Microsoft Azure, Kubernetes, Docker, Terraform, MongoDB, MySQL, Redis, Kafka, MCP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience level:&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years in software engineering, systems integration, DevOps, or data engineering roles with meaningful production responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; proven ability to lead and develop engineers (e.g., formal management, team lead responsibility, coaching, hiring, performance growth).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise delivery track record:&lt;/strong&gt; demonstrated success delivering complex technical projects in large enterprise environments with multiple stakeholders and constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical breadth and depth:&lt;/strong&gt; strong capabilities across backend engineering, APIs, cloud platforms, Kubernetes, infrastructure-as-code, and databases — able to review designs and guide production decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on effectiveness:&lt;/strong&gt; able to personally own and drive smaller technical workstreams end-to-end and to jump into debugging/implementation when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; strong planning, prioritization, capacity thinking, and risk management; creates delivery clarity without unnecessary process overhead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-facing communication:&lt;/strong&gt; confident and credible with customer engineering teams and senior technical stakeholders; clear written and verbal communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong plus: experience building or integrating AI/LLM-powered systems (agent workflows, orchestration, evaluation, vector DBs, guardrails), ideally in forward-deployed or solutions engineering environments.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Recruiting Process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Talent Acquisition → Hiring Manager → Technical Interview(s) → Bar Raiser&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Parloa?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re at the beginning of a new era in customer experience, one where AI doesn’t just respond, but understands, reasons, and takes action. We’re building agentic AI that enterprises trust with their most important customer moments: complex questions, high volumes, real stakes. When millions of people reach out to a brand, those interactions aren’t just support tickets; they’re defining experiences. We’re here to raise the standard: making every conversation seamless, intelligent, and genuinely helpful. If you care about shaping how businesses and customers connect at scale and want your work to matter in real, everyday moments, this is where you do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Parloa, ownership isn’t a buzzword; it means being accountable for outcomes, not just tasks. We operate in a category that’s evolving fast, where the bar is high, and the problems are complex. We hire people who think in solutions, communicate with clarity, and follow through. People who are comfortable making decisions, taking responsibility, and raising the standard for themselves and those around them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve grown beyond the earliest startup phase, but we’ve kept the intensity: fast execution, direct feedback, and a strong expectation to contribute meaningfully from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/P4d-iyx7RQM&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa is committed to upholding the highest data protection standards for our clients&#39; and employees&#39; data. All our employees are instrumental in ensuring the utmost care, GDPR, and ISO compliance, including ISO 27001, in handling sensitive information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa is an e-verify employer in the USA. &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/about-e-verify/what-is-e-verify&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/about-e-verify/what-is-e-verify&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Please click here to learn more&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;* &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We provide equal opportunities to all qualified applicants regardless race, gender, sexual orientation, age, religion, national origin, disability status, socioeconomic background and other characteristics.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wolt Market/HOP is Wolt/Deliveroo’s owned and operated grocery business, focused on delivering the best customer experience through high-quality selection, strong availability, and fast delivery. As 1P continues to scale across multiple countries, we are looking for a Manager, Strategy &amp;amp; Operations to help drive sustainable topline growth and bottomline performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role works closely with the Head of Wolt Mart / HOP&amp;nbsp; and Regional General Managers (RGMs) to define strategic priorities, drive key growth initiatives, and ensure delivery of financial and operational targets. The person will act as a key partner to Marketing, Finance, Category Management, and other global functional teams, ensuring alignment between strategy, planning, and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role combines strategic thinking with strong execution ownership, requiring exceptional analytical skills, structured problem solving, and the ability to lead cross-functional initiatives across 30+ markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Business Performance Ownership (Topline &amp;amp; Bottomline)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Head of Wolt Market / HOP and RGMs to drive sustainable growth and profitability across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and manage topline (GOV, orders, basket size) and bottomline (contribution margin, EBITDA, cost efficiency) performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify performance gaps, diagnose root causes, and drive corrective actions across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build forecasting models and performance tracking frameworks to ensure visibility and accountability against targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Strategic Planning &amp;amp; Financial Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Finance on annual planning, forecasting, and target setting processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development of long-term growth plans, investment cases, and strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment between financial targets and operational execution across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor performance vs plan and drive actions to close gaps where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Growth Initiatives &amp;amp; Marketing Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing to define and execute growth initiatives across acquisition, retention, and basket size expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritize high-impact growth levers and ensure effective execution across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure and evaluate impact of growth initiatives and continuously optimize based on performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development of scalable playbooks to drive consistent growth across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Cross Functional Leadership &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Category Management, Product, Operations, and other global teams to drive key strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional projects end-to-end, from problem definition to execution and impact measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable tools, processes, and operating models that enable strong execution across 30+ countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strong alignment between global strategy and local market execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Data, Analytics &amp;amp; Performance Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Looker, Excel, and other BI tools to analyze business performance and identify actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build dashboards, models, and performance tracking tools to support decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data into clear insights and strategic recommendations for senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support experimentation and test-and-learn approaches to optimize performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of relevant experience in Strategy &amp;amp; Operations, management consulting, investment banking, tech companies, or high-growth retail/e-commerce environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in fast-paced, high-growth, and cross-functional environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with financial planning, growth strategy, or operational performance management is strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical skills with strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Excel, including financial modelling, forecasting, and scenario analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience using BI tools such as Looker to extract insights and drive decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data-driven mindset with ability to translate data into actionable business recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL experience is a plus but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving &amp;amp; Strategic Thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding structured problem-solving skills with ability to break down complex and ambiguous problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify high-impact opportunities and prioritize effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business judgment and ability to connect strategy with operational execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work closely with senior stakeholders, including General Managers and global functional leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills across global and local teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence without authority and drive alignment across multiple functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with demonstrated experience leading cross-functional initiatives end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and workstreams simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership mindset with strong bias toward action and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full professional proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a global, fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, proactive, and highly motivated individual with strong ownership mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Product Manager to own our search experience that millions of customers land on when they open DoorDash, Wolt, or Deliveroo, and the single biggest lever we have on what they find.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role sits in our Core Consumer organisation in the Search domain, which is responsible for the in-app experience. You&#39;ll be building on a global stack, and your roadmap will be a mix: global platform problems that apply worldwide, global capabilities we&#39;re accelerating into EMEA markets, and EMEA-specific problems worth solving properly rather than working around.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Search is where customers tell us exactly what they want. Getting it right across restaurants, grocery, and retail - in every language we operate in - is one of the highest-intent and hardest problems in the app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll work on&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Query understanding, Autosuggestions and AI/ML problems in the Search domain&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where conversational and agentic search changes how customers get to a decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making search work across three brands, multiple languages, and query behaviour that differs market by market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a product leader more than a feature owner. Someone who can find the problems that matter most, for customers and for the business, and make the case for solving them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring proven experience as a Product Manager in Consumer, or on another relevance- or ranking-driven consumer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate fluency with search measurement and know how to actually move it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You show strong product judgment, backed by data literacy and customer insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work backwards from the customer problem, and you can weigh that against the most urgent business problems at the same time, rather than treating it as a side you have to pick.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think strategically: you can zoom out to where the domain should be in two years, then zoom back in on what we should ship next quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with ambiguity and genuinely flexible. This industry is changing fast, AI most of all, and the plan we write in January won&#39;t be the plan in June.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work deeply with ML and engineering on relevance and ranking, without needing to be an ML expert yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re curious about what AI actually changes for customers, and you can tell real value from hype.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build a case and bring people with you: engineering, design, analytics, and local market teams across three brands and many markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You do your best work with range: global platform thinking one week, a specific market&#39;s reality the next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position will be filled as soon as we find the right person, so make sure to apply as soon as you realize you really, really want to join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc?si=FzuwoSOLcv5WZVRN&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Center Transaction Principal, Europe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Transaction Principal for Europe at Anthropic, you&#39;ll drive the commercial sourcing and transaction execution process for our European data center capacity deals. You&#39;ll lead RFP processes, negotiate term sheets, and serve as the central leader ensuring seamless stakeholder alignment from initial sourcing through lease execution.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role is critical to securing the infrastructure that powers Anthropic&#39;s frontier AI systems across Europe — you&#39;ll bridge commercial negotiations with complex internal coordination across legal, finance, engineering, and network teams, and partner closely with our Compute Markets team who own the Europe market strategy and government relationships. This is not an established leasing org; you&#39;ll be building process alongside execution, and doing so across multiple countries with distinct regulatory, power, and development dynamics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lead the RFP and commercial sourcing process for European data center deals, managing developer outreach, proposal evaluation, and competitive selection across multiple markets&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Negotiate term sheets and manage the LOI process, structuring commercial terms that meet Anthropic&#39;s technical and business requirements while maintaining strong developer partnerships&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create the bridge from LOI to executed transaction, ensuring all commercial, technical, and legal requirements are satisfied for deal closure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Serve as project manager for cross-functional stakeholder engagement — coordinating due diligence teams, internal and external legal counsel, network organization, platform engineers, and finance to ensure alignment prior to lease execution&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Act as the single point of contact for auxiliary organizations including networks, deployments, and government relations, providing regular updates on transaction progress and leasing status&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Develop and maintain transaction timelines, tracking critical-path items and proactively identifying risks that could impact deal closure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ensure all stakeholder requirements are captured and addressed in commercial agreements, translating technical and operational needs into contractual terms&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Manage complex digital infrastructure development activities to a construction-ready state, through a developer or directly&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Marry the right projects, capital stacks, and developers at the right stages&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Navigate country-specific permitting, grid connection, and regulatory requirements that vary significantly across European markets&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Document and refine transaction processes and playbooks to enable scalable deal execution as Anthropic expands its infrastructure footprint across the region&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Partner with the Compute Markets Manager to prioritize markets, sites, and counterparties, and feed deal learnings back into Europe market strategy&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have 10+ years of experience in transaction management, commercial real estate, data center leasing, or infrastructure procurement&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Possess a proven track record of managing complex, multi-stakeholder transactions from sourcing through execution&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have strong negotiation skills with experience structuring term sheets, LOIs, and commercial agreements&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Excel at project management and can coordinate across legal, technical, finance, and operational teams simultaneously&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have experience with RFP processes and competitive sourcing for large-scale infrastructure or real estate transactions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have experience working in or across European markets, with knowledge of the regional data center and development landscape — including established FLAP-D hubs and emerging markets like the Nordics and Southern Europe&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are comfortable operating across multiple countries with different legal frameworks, languages, and business cultures&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are highly organized with strong attention to detail while maintaining focus on strategic deal objectives&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Can operate effectively in fast-paced, ambiguous environments where processes are being built alongside execution&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Demonstrate exceptional communication skills and can coordinate effectively across time zones with US-based HQ teams and distributed European partners&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It&#39;s a bonus if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have experience with data center or hyperscale infrastructure transactions specifically&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come from the development side of the industry rather than traditional brokerage/leasing — you understand how DC development works and how value is created (yield-on-cost, cap rates, development fees)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Understand technical requirements for AI/ML workloads including power density, cooling, and network connectivity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have worked with legal teams on complex lease negotiations or infrastructure agreements across multiple European jurisdictions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Understand utility coordination, power procurement, or energy considerations in data center transactions, particularly in the European context (fragmented national power markets, grid connection queues, renewable PPAs, sustainability and efficiency regulations)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have familiarity with data sovereignty and regulatory considerations that influence European site selection&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have relationships within the European data center developer, operator, and broker ecosystem&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a background in corporate development, strategic partnerships, or infrastructure investment&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have experience in high-growth technology companies managing infrastructure expansion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£1 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is looking for product engineers to build internal products. This role sits at the intersection of engineering, product, and design—you&#39;ll own outcomes, not just tasks. You&#39;ll work directly with users to understand their needs, identify the patterns behind their requests, and build the right abstractions that unlock capabilities for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly design, prototype, and ship full-stack features across backend, frontend, and infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consult with users and stakeholders to understand workflows and identify the highest-impact opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot patterns across user requests and reduce them into primitives, platforms, or middleware that support a variety of use cases—not just one-off features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build tools that maximize autonomy and creative freedom for less-technical users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make product and prioritization decisions, not just execute on specs handed to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iterate quickly based on feedback to continuously improve the user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pick up new tools, frameworks, and domains as the product evolves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 6+ years of experience building production software, ideally full-stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can operate as a team of one when needed—you&#39;re independently capable of taking a product from idea to shipped, even if you won&#39;t always work that way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think in systems and abstractions—you see the platform behind the feature request&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Care about empowering users, not just building for them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own outcomes, not just code—you care whether the thing you built actually solved the problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable making decisions with incomplete information and operating with ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold yourself to a high bar without needing external pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong candidates will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency across the stack (we use Python, TypeScript, React)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building platforms, primitives, or internal tools that others build on top of&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shipping products independently—not just contributing to larger efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deadline to apply: None. Applications will be received on a rolling basis.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£255,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£325,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
