&lt;li&gt;AI tools integration, for example embedding LLMs APIs or agents in pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very strong, AI-focused, Azure and AWS expertise
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience orchestrating GPU workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Azure Foundry and Bedrock&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Automation:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or using agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating DevOps infrastructure with MCPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Terragrunt and Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very good understanding of containerisation technologies&lt;/li&gt;
