&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, gender, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability, or any other class protected by legislation, and local law. SharkNinja will consider reasonable accommodations consistent with legislation, and local law. If you require a reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, please contact SharkNinja People &amp;amp; Culture at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----------
