We are looking for skilled Security Engineers with hands-on experience in automotive software development to join Mobileye’s Automotive Software team. In this role, you will work on designing and implementing security solutions, ensuring the security and robustness of automotive systems.&nbsp;
This is a real engineering role for those who love problem-solving, working at a low level, and getting their hands dirty with embedded system development. If you enjoy conceptualizing and developing software rather than making PowerPoint slides, this is the right place for you!&nbsp;What will your job look like?
Develop security solutions according to customer and Mobileye requirements, from concept to implementation&nbsp;
Implement and test/debug your application or system on a test bench, HIL, or other prototype environment&nbsp;
Collaborate with internal experts and customers to explain and align security concepts, ensuring system-wide integration

